<title>UK: Ashquay bid for UK Estates fails.</title>
<headline>Ashquay bid for UK Estates fails.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Ashquay Group Plc said on Tuesday its hostile bid for property development firm UK Estates Plc had lapsed.</p>
</text>
